{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "36eecb4a-c5a1-82f3-b2c6-93b0af1b25a8",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T10:55:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Walter Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:53:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:53:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. My name is Walter Gifford. I am calling about my water bill. It is, um, very high this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:53:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that, Mr. Gifford. Can I get the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:53:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "464 Farewell Street. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:53:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And do you know why the bill is higher than usual?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:53:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. A pipe broke in the cellar in February. The landlord had it fixed. Now the bill is three times what it should be. I would like to ask about a, a leak adjustment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:53:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there is an adjustment process for leaks that have been repaired. You would need to send a copy of the plumber's invoice or repair receipt, along with the bill. I can note the account now and have the form sent to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:54:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I am a renter, so the landlord has the invoice. I will ask him for it. [pause] Also, I lost the bill. I need a duplicate copy. Can you send it by email?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can. What email address would you like it sent to? Please spell it slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:54:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would rather not say it on the phone, it is long. Can you use the one on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:54:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me check. Yes, there is an email on file. I'll send the duplicate there within the hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Now, the payment. I work during the day. I am a court stenographer. I record every word in the courtroom, so I cannot leave early. City Hall hours do not fit my schedule. Can I pay online from work on my lunch break?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:54:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you can pay online. The city website has a utility payment page. You'll need your account number from the bill, and you can pay by card or bank transfer. The duplicate I'm sending will have the account number on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:55:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is good. It is annoying to take time off just to pay a bill that is wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:55:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Once the adjustment request is in, the billing office will review it. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:55:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That is all. Thank you, Miss Raman."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:55:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Gifford. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
